<title>USA: ClinTrials says to build new center in UK.</title>
<headline>ClinTrials says to build new center in UK.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>ClinTrials Research Ltd said on Tuesday that it will build a clinical data management facility in Glasgow, Scotland, its second major clinical research center in the United Kingdom.</p>
<p>ClinTrials declined to say how much the new facility would cost, but predicted the project would create about 240 new jobs over the next two years.</p>
<p>ClinTrials conducts clinical research on behalf of the pharmaceutical, bio-technology and medical device industries.</p>
